---
import { courseOutline, courseLessonHref } from '../../data/courseOutline';
---
<section class="home-section home-learning" id="learning-paths" aria-labelledby="learning-paths-title">
  <div class="home-section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">01 / 从这里开始</div><h2 id="learning-paths-title">从生活里的问题，开始学习经济</h2></div><a class="home-inline-link" href="/learn/">查看学习主线 →</a></div>
  <p>不需要先记住一串名词。从一份早餐开始，看看购买、收入、生产和工作怎样联系起来。</p>
  <a class="home-learning-card" href={courseLessonHref(courseOutline[0].id)}>
    <span class="eyebrow">第一章</span>
    <strong>{courseOutline[0].title}</strong>
    <span>{courseOutline[0].summary}</span>
    <b>开始第一章 →</b>
  </a>
</section>
